<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Sampling Parameters for Evaluation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As samplers, <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max_tokens</span> is set to 32768 for all open-source models. As graders, it is set to 4096 for non-reasoning models and 8192 when thinking is enabled. For GPT-4.1, the parameters stay identical to those provided in the original repo. Other sampling parameters are summarized in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Sampling Parameters for Evaluation ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Self-Rewarding Rubric-Based Reinforcement Learning for Open-Ended Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Sampling parameters for evaluation</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T6.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Model</th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Temperature</th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">TopP</th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">TopK</th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">MinP</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T6.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
