</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS5.SSSx38.p27.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.SS5.SSSx38.p27.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Points</span></span>
